poppler_decrypt
===============

Lightweight standalone PDF Standard Security Handler decryption module
(MD5, RC4, AES-128-CBC, AES-256-CBC, SHA-256/384/512, PDF R2-R6 key derivation)
extracted from upstream Poppler (poppler/Decrypt.h & poppler/Decrypt.cc).

Adapted to operate directly on in-memory std::vector<unsigned char> buffers
without pulling in Poppler's GooString/Stream/Object runtime.

